  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "3466d969-06fb-48b3-a2bc-3f2915c179eb",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol a uma lembranca cultural muito viva.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "6394249f-9948-4c77-b30a-f8d901d6e05b",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a saida do cinema e escute a frase.</p><p><strong>Recuerdo aquel final como si fuera ayer.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Lembro daquele final como se fosse ontem.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/bd21ce5da82248b980eaf3651af7c00e_l07b01-cinema-memory-scene.png?Expires=1794099857&Signature=nC9yMoC7ulS7WrXpft-gPfFz69JeMjTPE0cig4kHUy1IbPUiVr3Ac1mHi3yljOpDzpB4ng~RM36ItFoYg7mKJ3XRvC2X8AImQBf~9cs89jI6RoUzzwzBCQoueKQ5pB50gpOZuKOJCVvp90oFKo5tqqNsPKncDX38-H00UoLZyNH7sVj1qzQH7MiL4G7p1DSUazh3ShAQrC3ebbHMRVOBN2HWCt5FwMIeVKjO5K45IKtqxaNLycmPqewMl8ZUFlyC8VpyLGBimGF3WDw0LUNl4yezHxhw9FcJz6IV6Zy3oUrrhF2vxanUQFaGEklTHcl3kA-rEiRn7Wu2tljaEs7z4w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
