        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">La voz de la actriz me sigue resonando.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">A voz da atriz ainda continua ressoando em mim.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e1aa78713fca48b0950db658c4450905_l07b05-la-voz-de-la-actriz-me-sigue-resonando.mp3?Expires=1794099857&Signature=2P1w9UORK8TmzRCu9rfH6QakyHDPA27UKT4QhUBAcWZ65lHTfFqhOIzbcrlhlWvK2QieNcx0UUSXJZAVtPjI-QhgrcVulKK~rxgJwcUllZxtroh6hUk8ZQN8u5PIv9szBmffeNcfCuCRKWFWRW~Rg8kBvdnp1lHkM~2Y4VMgCOKRwroMg8EPzEKRufnprfnaQHIYiuManzkoN59KWA1OI9ztxLn1p6Zzbq9QjJJPuW~duASCRJ6V66BNYLoA3ifEJn3P5xT3dnrIfWtWTZjy203lgt7O9s~LP3Ob2kbKHN5V92sYWms4GUqUbEBwyoTV8eQdhh81WBKvPJG8Dqzmpg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
